/* HexBridge — English interface strings.

   English is the default language of the app and this file is the original; the
   Russian file next to it is the wording the interface shipped with before it
   became bilingual. Both files hold exactly the same keys, and every key here
   has the same substitutions in the same order over there — LocalizationTests
   fails the build if either stops being true.

   The vocabulary is fixed by docs/GLOSSARY.md, which the Windows side follows
   too. Three rules from it are easy to break by accident: the seven state words
   are the same seven words for every feature, "sender" and "receiver" never
   appear (people think about where the microphone is, not about roles), and
   there are no exclamation marks and no apologies anywhere. */

